# Routing & Navigation

- Routes live in `src/App.tsx`; pages in `src/pages/`.
- Sidebar items live in `src/components/AppLayout.tsx` `nav` array.
- New navigable page: add page + route + sidebar item together.
- Detail pages usually do not need a sidebar entry.
- `/workers` route may be commented; `/datasets` may exist without a sidebar entry — do not assume they are visible in the UI.
- Unmatched routes redirect to `/`.
